-- title:
--   Restarting a cluster-manager-eligible node preserves the invariant
-- statement:
--   Let `P` satisfy `P.InitCompatible` and `P.strategy = ElectionStrategy.DEFAULT_INSTANCE`, and let `W` satisfy `Inv P W`. For every node `n` with `P.eligible n = true` and every cluster state `s'` with `RestartState (W.node n).lastAcceptedState s'`: `Inv P (W.set n (CoordinationState.init (W.node n).localNode (W.node n).currentTerm s'))`. The hypotheses on `P` are not used.
